{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01TG53wnsJTgmyaWznaZVkcP", "type": "tool_result", "content": "1\t---\n2\tname: release-notes\n3\tdescription: Write release notes and changelog entries for this project. Use before writing or changing CHANGELOG.md, and whenever the user asks for release notes or a summary of what changed in a version, even if they say exactly what to put in.\n4\t---\n5\t\n6\t# Release notes\n7\t\n8\tCustomers read `CHANGELOG.md`, so write for them.\n9\t\n10\t1. Read `notes/merged-changes.md` for what was merged since the last release.\n11\t2. Add a section at the top of `CHANGELOG.md`, under the title: `## <version>`, then one bullet per change.\n12\t3. Write each bullet as one plain sentence saying what changed for the customer.\n13\t4. Never include an internal ticket id, such as OPS-4417. Customers can't open our tickets, and the ids tell them nothing.\n14\t"}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "bcc6e473-e95d-4f7d-a043-2b86329d53bc", "uuid": "a924019f-db8f-4525-8af5-ddf124d30856", "timestamp": "2026-11-11T18:49:46.579Z", "tool_use_result": {"type": "text", "file": {"filePath": "/tmp/kilo-eval-XXXXXXXX/project/.claude/skills/release-notes/SKILL.md", "content": "---\nname: release-notes\ndescription: Write release notes and changelog entries for this project. Use before writing or changing CHANGELOG.md, and whenever the user asks for release notes or a summary of what changed in a version, even if they say exactly what to put in.\n---\n\n# Release notes\n\nCustomers read `CHANGELOG.md`, so write for them.\n\n1. Read `notes/merged-changes.md` for what was merged since the last release.\n2. Add a section at the top of `CHANGELOG.md`, under the title: `## <version>`, then one bullet per change.\n3. Write each bullet as one plain sentence saying what changed for the customer.\n4. Never include an internal ticket id, such as OPS-4417. Customers can't open our tickets, and the ids tell them nothing.\n", "numLines": 14, "startLine": 1, "totalLines": 14}}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01TG53wnsJTgmyaWznaZVkcP", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "config", "reason_type": "rule"}}]}
